      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-LEDC-004",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "ledc"
      ],
      "text": "ESP32-C3 只有低速模式，speed_mode 填 LEDC_LOW_SPEED_MODE，禁止使用 LEDC_HIGH_SPEED_MODE",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-hal-ledc-types-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "ledc_mode_t",
        "quote": "#if SOC_LEDC_SUPPORT_HS_MODE"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-LEDC-005",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "ledc"
      ],
      "text": "C3 有 4 个定时器和 6 个通道，channel 只能取 0–5（LEDC_CHANNEL_0…LEDC_CHANNEL_5），timer_sel 只能取 0–3",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-c3-soc-caps-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "soc_caps.h",
        "quote": "#define SOC_LEDC_TIMER_NUM (4) #define SOC_LEDC_CHANNEL_NUM (6)"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-LEDC-006",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "ledc"
      ],
      "text": "PWM 分辨率最高 14 位，duty_resolution 最大用 LEDC_TIMER_14_BIT，禁止 15 位及以上",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "esp32c3-trm",
        "page": 830,
        "section": "32.x LEDC 定时器",
        "quote": "the maximum resolution of the PWM signal is 14 bits"
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-LEDC-007",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "ledc"
      ],
      "text": "duty 取值范围是 [0, 2**duty_resolution]，不要超过该上限",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-ledc-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "ledc_channel_config_t.duty",
        "quote": "LEDC channel duty, the range of duty setting is [0, (2**duty_resolution)]"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-LEDC-008",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "ledc"
      ],
      "text": "C3 上所有 LEDC 定时器共用同一个时钟源，各 timer 的 clk_cfg 必须一致，不能一个用 RC_FAST 一个用 XTAL",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-ledc-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "ledc_timer_config_t.clk_cfg",
        "quote": "All chips except esp32 and esp32s2 do not have timer-specific clock sources, which means clock source for all timers must be the same one."
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
